      "Tipo de acesso usado: Gather\n",
      "Min: 3918.87 ms\n",
      "Max: 8510.59 ms\n",
      "Média: 5566.72 ms\n",
      "Mediana: 4911.44 ms\n",
      "Tempos brutos: [7155.382105000172, 4615.9493199998, 4615.666056000009, 6489.707744000043, 5206.927699000062, 8510.593832999803, 4137.147869000273, 4032.932114000232, 6984.046412000225, 3918.866409000202]\n"
